{
    "comment": "상품 폼 — 라벨 해제 확인. 그 라벨에 노출 기간을 걸어 두었다면 해제와 함께 그 설정이 사라지므로,\n  걸린 기간을 보여 주고 되묻는다. 기간 값은 폼이 들고 있어 `$parent` 로 건너다본다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Product Form - Label Uncheck Confirmation Modal (engine-v1.16.0: $parent 바인딩 사용)"
    },
    "id": "modal_label_uncheck_confirm",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.labels.uncheck_modal.title",
        "size": "sm"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-start ecommerce:gap-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:w-10 ecommerce:h-10 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:bg-yellow-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-yellow-900/20 ecommerce:justify-center ecommerce:flex-shrink-0"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "exclamation-triangle",
                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-xl ecommerce:text-yellow-700 ecommerce:dark:text-yellow-400"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:flex-1"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:mb-2"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "라벨 칩 — 운영자 색은 바탕에만 쓰고 글자색은 Badge 가 바탕과 4.5 이상이 되도록 계산한다",
                                            "type": "composite",
                                            "name": "Badge",
                                            "props": {
                                                "size": "md",
                                                "customColor": "{{(product_labels?.data?.data ?? []).find(l => l.id === _global.labelToUncheckId)?.color ?? '#6B7280'}}"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{$localized((product_labels?.data?.data ?? []).find(l => l.id === _global.labelToUncheckId)?.name) ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.labels.uncheck_modal.message"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "if": "{{($parent._local.form.label_assignments ?? []).find(a => a.label_id === _global.labelToUncheckId)?.started_at || ($parent._local.form.label_assignments ?? []).find(a => a.label_id === _global.labelToUncheckId)?.ended_at}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-label-subtle ecommerce:mt-2 ecommerce:font-medium"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{($parent._local.form.label_assignments ?? []).find(a => a.label_id === _global.labelToUncheckId)?.started_at ?? ''}} ~ {{($parent._local.form.label_assignments ?? []).find(a => a.label_id === _global.labelToUncheckId)?.ended_at ?? ''}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:justify-end ecommerce:gap-3 ecommerce:border-t ecommerce:border-gray-200 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "closeModal"
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "ecommerce-btn ecommerce-btn-outline"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.common.cancel"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sirsoft-ecommerce.confirmUncheckLabel"
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "ecommerce-btn ecommerce-btn-warning"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.labels.uncheck_modal.confirm"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
